  "pages": [
    {
      "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
      "item": "theoreticalsciences:anomaly_containment_ward",
      "title": "Anomaly Containment Ward",
      "text": "A quarantine cell of chronoplastic walls, causal shielding and windows of containment glass, with dimensional stabilisers at every corner. It lets what it holds grow - just slower than its field can clear it.$(br2)$(thing)Tier 5$() machine."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "This controller is too complex for a crafting grid. Build it on the $(item)Femtoscale Assembly Line$() - check JEI for the exact parts."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "Turns what containment failures leave behind - $(item)Fractured Essence$(), $(item)Void Essence$(), $(item)Paradox Residue$(), $(item)Nanite Swarms$(), $(item)Law Crystals$() - into $(item)Contained Anomaly Specimens$(), and later grows $(item)Local Law Violations$(), $(item)Symbiont Cultures$(), the $(item)Anomaly Catalogue$() and $(item)Quarantine Field Matrices$(). Keep R = \u03b2/(\u03b3 + q) below 1."
    },
